<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Yellow said raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Yellow said raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Yellow Corp was raised to a buy from a hold rating at Prudential on Friday, according to a Prudential source.</p>
<p>-- Yellow shares closed at 12-1/2 on Thursday.</p>
</text>
